  "html": "\n<div align=\"center\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><font color=\"#333333\"><a name=\"top\"></a></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"left\" height=\"25\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"630\">\n\n<font class=\"combo\" id=\"combos\" style=\"cursor:hand;\">Catalog*******</font>\n<div id=\"myDIV\">\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_alchemy/\" title=\"연금술[포션제작]\">Alchemy+</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_poisoning/\" title=\"포이즈닝[독바르기]\">Poisoning</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_taste/\" title=\"맛감정\">Taste ID</a><br>\n\t\t\t------------\n\t\t\t<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_blacksmith/\" title=\"스미스[대장장이]\">Black Smith+</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_mining/\" title=\"광부[광물캐기]\">Mining</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_armslore/\" title=\"암즈로어[장비지식]\">Arms Lore</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_item/\" title=\"아이템ID[아이템감정]\">Item ID</a><br>\n                        ------------\n\t\t\t<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_car/\" title=\"카펜터리[목공술]\">Carpentry</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_lumber/\" title=\"럼버잭[나무하기]\">Lumberjacking</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_thinker/\" title=\"팅거링[기계공기술]\">Tinkering</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_bow/\" title=\"보우크래프트[활제작술]\">Bowcraft</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_fishing/\" title=\"피싱[낚시]\">Fishing</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_ins/\" title=\"인스크립션[기록술]\">Inscription</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_tailor/\" title=\"재단사[재봉술]\">Tailor</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_cooking/\" title=\"쿠킹[요리]\">Cooking</a><br>\n<a class=\"com\" href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_begging/\" title=\"베깅[구걸]\">Begging</a><br><br>\n</div><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/jobs_logo.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"17\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"200\">\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</font>&nbsp;</p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolordark=\"#666666\" bordercolorlight=\"black\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"600\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td height=\"30\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;<font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><img border=\"0\" height=\"30\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/t.gif\" width=\"30\">AILOR \n                            - 1 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"19\">\n</b></span></font><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_tailor/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/car_1.gif\" width=\"50\"></font></b></span></a><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/2.gif\" width=\"19\">\n</b></span></font><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_tailor_1/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/left_menu/alpha/car_2.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"50\"></font></b></span></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"22\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>A</b>. \n                            <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"28\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/knit.gif\" width=\"28\">테일러는 재단사로 옷을 만드는 직업입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n                            </span></font><a href=\"/site/bod/bod/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"Verdana\">BOD(벌크디드시스템)</font></b></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">에서 다양한&nbsp;보상품을 \n                            얻을 수도 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">테일러라는 \n                            직업을 원하시는분은 일단 옷을 만들 때 쓰는 도구와 \n                            많은 재료들을 알아야 합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>B</b>. \n                            도구</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:17;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"1\" height=\"40\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/tailo_shop.gif\" width=\"100\"></span></font><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/skill_map.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"Verdana\">옷가게(가위그림)이 \n                            있는 상점</font></b></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">에서 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/sew.gif\" width=\"22\">바느질도구와 \n                            <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/soc.gif\" width=\"20\">가위를 \n                            구입합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:17;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n                            팅거링(기계공기술)로 플레이어가 직접 만드실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>C</b>. \n                            재료</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>1</b>. \n                            천</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">천가게(가위그림)이 \n                            있는 상점에서 말린천(두루마기 천)을 지피를 주고 \n                            손쉽게 구입하여 옷을</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">만들 \n                            수 있습니다. 아래에서는 플레이어가 직접 말린천을 \n                            얻기 위한 일련의 공정과정을 살펴봅시다.</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"olive\" bordercolordark=\"olive\" bordercolorlight=\"olive\" cellpadding=\"8\" cellspacing=\"0\" width=\"560\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td> <p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ⅰ</span></font><font color=\"#000066\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">.<img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"23\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/sheep.gif\" width=\"24\">\n</span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">양(Sheep)에서 <img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"25\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/cotton.gif\" width=\"28\">양털을 \n                            얻는 과정</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">양을 \n                            자신이 가지고 있는 단검(칼,도끼종류)를 더블클릭 \n                            후 타겟이 활성화 된 후 양을 클릭 하시면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">양털을 \n                            얻을 수 있게 됩니다. 양이 주로 있는 지역은 델루시아 \n                            북문서쪽, 젤롬, 요우남쪽, 일쉐나</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">숭고함게이트 \n                            서쪽지역에 있는 목장에서 주로 보실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이때 \n                            유의할점은 칼을 이용하여 양털을 얻는다면 1개를 얻을 \n                            수 있고 양을 죽인 후 시체에서</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">양털을 얻는다면 \n                            3개를 얻을 수 있지만 말린천으로 바꿀 때의 &nbsp;양은 \n                            같게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">즉, \n                            단검을 이용한 1개의 양털의 양 = 죽인 후 시체에서 \n                            얻은 양털 3개의 양입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ⅱ. \n                            <img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"35\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/cotton_1.gif\" width=\"30\">목화에서 \n                            <img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/cotton_3.gif\" width=\"32\">면을 \n                            얻는 과정</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">목화를 \n                            더블클릭하면 그 자리에서 면으로 바뀌게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">목화는 \n                            스카라브레이스 섬에서 동쪽 지역에 있는 대륙(미로의 \n                            서쪽)에서 발견 하실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또는 \n                            브리튼 동쪽 근처의 NPC외곽마을 지역에서도 보실 수 \n                            있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">p.s \n                                        : NPC상점에서 파는 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"26\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/bong.gif\" width=\"28\">섬유더미도 \n                                        </span></font><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/cotton_3.gif\" width=\"32\">면과 \n                                        같은 재료입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ⅲ. \n                            <img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"25\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/cotton.gif\" width=\"28\">양털 \n                            또는<img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/cotton_3.gif\" width=\"32\">면을 \n                            이용하여 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/yarn.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"18\">실뭉치와 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"12\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/spool.gif\" width=\"12\">실감개(Spool)를 만드는&nbsp;과정</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" height=\"80\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/wheel.gif\" width=\"42\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;a.양털 \n                            더블 클릭 후 타겟이 활성화되면 물레(Wheel)을 클릭하여 \n                            주면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;계속해서 \n                            반복적으로 해주시면 실뭉치가 나오게 됩니다. (양털 \n                            1개=실뭉치 3개)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;b.면을 \n                            더블클릭 후 타겟이 활성화되면 물레(Wheel)을 클릭하여 \n                            주면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;계속해서 \n                            반복적으로 해주시면 실감개가 나오게 됩니다. (면 \n                            1개=실감개 3개)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ⅳ. \n                            <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/yarn.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"18\">실뭉치와 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"12\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/spool.gif\" width=\"12\">실감개를 이용하여 말린천을 만드는 과정</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/wheel_1.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"128\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"70\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;실뭉치 \n                            혹은 실감개를 더블클릭 하여 타겟이 활성화되면 베틀의 \n                            중앙부분을 클릭하여 &nbsp;줍니다. 베틀과 물레는 테일러상점에 있거나 플레이어(목공술)가 \n                            만들 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;각각의 \n                            5개 실뭉치 혹은 실감개는 1개의 </span></font><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/bolt_2.gif\" width=\"25\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/bolt_3.gif\" width=\"25\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"60\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/bolt_1.gif\" width=\"25\"></span></font><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">말린천을 \n                            생성하게 해줍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Ⅴ. \n                                        말린천을 이용한 천만들기</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/soc.gif\" width=\"20\">가위를 \n                                        더블클릭 후 타겟이 활성화 되면 말린천을 \n                                        클릭하여 주시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">또는 \n                                        <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/sew.gif\" width=\"22\">바느질도구를 \n                                        더블클릭 후 메뉴창이 활성화 되면 기타재료-접힌천을 \n                                        선택하여 천을 \n                                        만들어 주시면 됩니다. 이렇게 \n                                        만든 천이 우리가 간편하게 쓸 수 있는 \n                                        천이 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">물론 \n                                        npc가 파는 천을 Gp(금화)를 주고 구입하여 \n                                        쓰실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">P.S \n                                        : 천을 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/soc.gif\" width=\"20\">가위를 \n                                        이용하여 한번더 짜르게 되면 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/bandage.gif\" width=\"20\">붕대가 \n                                        됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이러한 \n                                        붕대는 전사 플레이어가 전투시 자신의 \n                                        히트포인트를 회복하거나(힐링기술) 테이머가 \n                                        자신의</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">애완동물의 \n                                        히트포인트를 회복시키는데(동물치료기술) \n                                        이용하게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/point.gif\" width=\"15\"> \n                                        염색약을 이용한 천 염색하기</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">NPC상점에서 \n                                        <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"22\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/dye_1.gif\" width=\"22\">염색약과 \n                                        <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"26\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/dye.gif\" width=\"26\">염색통을 \n                                        구입합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">염색약을 \n                                        더블클릭 후 염색통을 클릭하시면 염색메뉴창이 \n                                        활성화 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이때 \n                                        플레이어가 원하시는 색을 선택한 후 OK버턴을 \n                                        누르시면 해당 염색통은 해당 색으로</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">변하게 \n                                        됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">색이 \n                                        변한&nbsp;염색통을 더블클릭 후 타겟이 \n                                        활성화 되면 원하시는 옷이나 천등에 클릭하여 \n                                        주시면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당색으로 \n                                        변하게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">P.S \n                                        : 나무로만든 가구와 가죽으로만든 가죽옷등은 \n                                        해당 가구염색통과 가죽염색통으로만</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">염색이 \n                                        가능합니다. 염색하는 방법은 위와 동일하며 \n                                        각각의 염색통은 </span></font><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_old/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"Verdana\">올드비보상</font></b></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">으로 얻으실 \n                                        수</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">P.S \n                                        : 특수한 색의 천과 샌달은 </span></font><a href=\"/site/bod/tailor_list/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>BOD보상</b></font></span></a><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">으로 \n                                        얻으실 수 있습니다. </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\">\n</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:70%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:23;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>2.</b> \n                            가죽<img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"35\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/lether_1.gif\" width=\"40\"></span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가죽은 \n                            천을 이용한 옷 이외에도 플레이어에게 가죽옷을 만들 \n                            수 있게 해줍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">가죽의 \n                            종류는 총 4가지로 분류되며 해당 몹을 죽인 후 단검을 \n                            이용(더블클릭)하여 시체를 클릭 하면 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">시체안에서 \n                            가죽을 얻을 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">일반가죽은 \n                            동물류가 주고 특수가죽을 얻을 수 있는 몬스터는 다음과 \n                            같습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"white\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\" width=\"540\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td align=\"center\" bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"180\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/spined_leather.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"40\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"44\">가시달린가죽(Spined)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\" width=\"180\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"40\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/horned_leather.gif\" width=\"44\">뿔달린가죽(Horned)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td bgcolor=\"#CCCC99\" width=\"180\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" data-original-src=\"http://forg.co.kr:80/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/barbed_leather.gif\" data-recovery=\"missing\" height=\"40\" src=\"/img/placeholder/missing.svg\" width=\"44\">미늘가죽(Barbed)</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"180\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:5; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Alligator/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Alligator(악어)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Dire%20Wolf.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Dire \n                                        Wolf(다이어울프)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Lizard%20man.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Lizard \n                                        man(리자드맨)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/RatMan/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">RatMan(랫맨-쥐돌이)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Giant%20Toad.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Giant \n                                        Toad(큰개구리)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Giant%20Serpent.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Giant \n                                        Serpent(큰뱀)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Imp.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Imp(임프)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Lava%20Serpent.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Lava \n                                        Serpent(라바셔펜트)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Lava%20Lizard.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Lava \n                                        Lizard(라바리자드)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/HellCat/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">HellCat(헬캣)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:5;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Ridgeback/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Ridgeback(릿지백)</font></span></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"180\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Drake/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Drake(드레이크)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Sea%20Serpent.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Sea \n                                        Serpent(시서펜)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Wyvern/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Wyvern(와이번)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Unicorn/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Unicorn(유니콘)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Kirin/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Kirin(기린)</font></span></a></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"180\"> <p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Dragon/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Dragon(드래곤-용갈)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Whte%20Wyrm.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">White \n                                        Wyrm(화이트웜)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Nightmare/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Nightmare(나이트메어)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Acient%20Wyrm.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Acient \n                                        Wyrm(고대용)</font></span></a></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" width=\"533\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:3; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-가시달린 \n                                        가죽을 손쉽게 얻을 수 있는 것은 릿지백으로 \n                                        </span></font><a href=\"/site/dungeon/I_Exodus/\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"Verdana\"><b>Exodus(엑소더스던전)</b></font></span></a><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">쪽으로 \n                                        가는</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">일쉐나 \n                                        중앙지역에 있는 릿지백서식지역에서 구하시면 \n                                        됩니다. </font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">물론 \n                                        가실 때는 </font><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_knowhow_addon_5/\"><b><font color=\"#006600\" face=\"Verdana\">야만족페인트</font></b></a><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">를 온몸에 바르시고 \n                                        가시길 권장합니다.</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">-뿔달린가죽은 \n                                        와이번을 권장 합니다. T2A 등대 하단에 \n                                        있는 와이번섬에서도 얻을 수 있고 </font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"Verdana\">데스타드 \n                                        던전지역에서도 얻을 수 있습니다.</font></span></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-미늘가죽은 \n                                        데스타드의 드래곤에서 얻는 것이 편합니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:10;\"><font color=\"maroon\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-펠루카대륙은 \n                                        자원(광물,나무,가죽,양털,깃털)이 2배로 \n                                        나오게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">-대량의 \n                                        가죽을 운반하실 때는 가위를 이용하여 \n                                        편가죽으로 만들어 주시길 바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><img align=\"left\" border=\"1\" height=\"40\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/menu_1.gif\" width=\"150\"></span></font>&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">바느질도구를 \n                                        더블클릭 후 메뉴창이 활성화되면 좌측하단에 \n                                        있는 </span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">메뉴에서 \n                                        원하시는 가죽의 재료를 선택하여 주시길 \n                                        바랍니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:50%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:10;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:3; margin-left:10;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">P.S \n                                        : 일반 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"38\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/leather.gif\" width=\"44\">통가죽은 \n                                        5스톤이며 가위를 이용하여 짜른 가죽은 \n                                        <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"35\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/lether_1.gif\" width=\"40\">1스톤입니다.</span></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p style=\"line-height:30%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><b>3</b>.<img align=\"absbottom\" border=\"0\" height=\"32\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/bone_1.gif\" width=\"45\">뼈(Bone)</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">뼈는 \n                            본아머를 만들 때 쓰이는 재료입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">뼈는 \n                            다음의 몬스터에서 얻을 수 있습니다. 손쉽게 얻을 \n                            수 있는 몬스터는 쉐도우위습과 호드미니언입니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">블랙위습은 \n                            일쉐나 숭고함의 북쪽지역에서 호드미니언은 헤븐지역 \n                            북서쪽 슾지역에서 만나실 수 있습니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">======================</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Giant%20Serpent.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Giant \n                                        Serpent(큰뱀)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/GiantIceSerpent/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Giant \n                            Ice \n                                        Serpent(아이스 큰뱀)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Zombie/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Zombie(좀비)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Skeleton%20Knight.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Skeleton \n                                        Knight(스케레톤 나이트)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Bone%20Knight.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Bone \n                                        Knight(본 나이트)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20021206194713/http://hosting27.interpia98.net/~forg/dungeon/Horde%20Minion.html\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Horde Minion(호드 \n                            미니언)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><a href=\"/site/dungeon/Wisp/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"navy\" face=\"Verdana\">Shadow \n                            Wisp(쉐도우위습)</font></span></a></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">======================</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">여러 \n                            가지 뼈종류를 한가지로 만드는 방법은 우선 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/soc.gif\" width=\"20\">가위를 \n                            더블클릭 후 타겟이 활성화되면</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">해당 \n                            뼈를 클릭하여 주시면 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0; margin-left:18;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">이렇게 \n                            잘라진 뼈들은 &nbsp;이런 <img align=\"absmiddle\" border=\"0\" height=\"18\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/uojobs/tailor/bone_2.gif\" width=\"18\">뼈의 \n                            상태로 모아지게 됩니다.</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">&nbsp;</span></font></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Verdana\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Written \n                By Forg</span></font></b></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font><a href=\"#top\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"16\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/top_up.gif\" width=\"50\"></a></p>\n<p align=\"right\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"630\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;<img border=\"0\" height=\"15\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/b_logo.gif\" width=\"100\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\">&nbsp;</p>\n",
  "redirectTo": null,
  "baseTarget": null
}
